content.text:
Both tasks are in progress:

- **SMA-820:** I added the Gemini bug as "Part 2", with the required behaviour and acceptance criteria. Part 2 also requires a live or proxy check of whether Gemini rejects a name that does not match its call. I linked SMA-820 to SMA-810 and recorded the decision in the spec.
- **Re-challenge:** an Opus challenger now reviews only the reworked G4, G5 and tests T10 to T14. I asked it to check these points:
  - whether the scan before `HandoffOccurred` always finds exactly the transfer calls;
  - whether the pairing rule can choose a wrong result;
  - whether the new position is valid for every provider translator;
  - whether the text change can report "transferred" when that is false;
  - the interaction with `Compacted`;
  - whether a result can arrive after the AG-UI alias table is cleared.

When the challenger finishes, I will add the justified findings and show you the result. Then I start the plan.

